+
+Request: users report `applyPatch` accepting patches they consider invalid, surprising edge cases and
+unexpected failure behaviour; review checking and application and conform to RFC 6902, errors included.
+
+Review result: validation (ops, members, pointers), atomic failure, move/copy/test semantics, array
+index rules and root handling all matched the RFC under probing. One deviation fixed: `replace` was
+implemented as remove + add, which moved an object member to the end; it now replaces in place.
+Test added in `test/patch.test.ts`.
